{"text_sha256":"97e6d1e1b642ebd83236074e2ad77305b5c91384ac49bc7eaef17474caeed5a0","text":"From April 2026, employers will be able to create and publish a voluntary action plan alongside their gender pay gap data. This applies to organisations with 250 or more employees.\n\nAction plans will show the steps organisations are taking to:\n\nreduce their gender pay gap\n\nsupport employees experiencing menopause\n\nTo help employers take effective action, we have provided a list of 18 recommended, evidence-informed actions. Employers must choose at least 2 actions in their first action plan.","structures":{"0f190e0d95fd71da9f95a1bc6812dd3790a096bc71590b7255470ce764776427":[{"tag":"p","start":0,"end":180,"children":[]},{"tag":"p","start":182,"end":243,"children":[]},{"tag":"ul","start":245,"end":314,"children":[{"tag":"li","start":245,"end":272,"children":[{"tag":"p","start":245,"end":272,"children":[]}]},{"tag":"li","start":274,"end":314,"children":[{"tag":"p","start":274,"end":314,"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"p","start":316,"end":495,"children":[]}],"c6b4e67c33b278492d3d665a1f9926a8dbdb321279d42ef7a7c80d3e8fd3c2fc":[{"tag":"p","start":0,"end":180,"children":[]},{"tag":"p","start":182,"end":243,"children":[]},{"tag":"ul","start":245,"end":314,"children":[{"tag":"li","start":245,"end":272,"children":[{"tag":"p","start":245,"end":272,"children":[]}]},{"tag":"li","start":274,"end":314,"children":[{"tag":"p","start":274,"end":314,"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"p","start":316,"end":495,"children":[]}],"3fdbe655d568deac5630b1870fc08df5d009d83f563005379d7d0cbe68ff3a31":[{"tag":"p","start":0,"end":180,"children":[]},{"tag":"p","start":182,"end":243,"children":[]},{"tag":"ul","start":245,"end":314,"children":[{"tag":"li","start":245,"end":272,"children":[{"tag":"p","start":245,"end":272,"children":[]}]},{"tag":"li","start":274,"end":314,"children":[{"tag":"p","start":274,"end":314,"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"p","start":316,"end":495,"children":[]}],"1bb3083b9ba7bab233de65c46038ad32a6e90